Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.06,0:01:54.70,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(410,474)\fad(300,000)}Demon Spirit Land\NEast Demon Spirit Sea
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.21,0:01:55.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can the spiritual energy in here be so thin ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.85,0:01:57.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s no different from the mortal world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.89,0:01:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about this place
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.97,0:02:02.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,so I should first find someone to question.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.77,0:02:13.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.86,0:02:22.90,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(468,464)}Thirteen\NLuo Family Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.41,0:02:30.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ve finally got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.14,0:02:52.74,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(350,435)}Luo Family Valley
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:57.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is exceedingly profound.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.01,0:02:59.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can conceal all signs of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.41,0:03:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was made with a different method than that of the Cultivation Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.49,0:03:06.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks like the work of ancient cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.85,0:03:10.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s him !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.49,0:03:19.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where are we ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.21,0:03:22.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,And what is this formation guarding ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.85,0:03:24.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.25,0:03:25.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.33,0:03:27.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Patriarch Ouyang won’t let you go !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.29,0:03:29.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:32.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,I request to speak with whoever owns this valley.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:37.66,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1506,481)\fad(300,000)}Ouyang Hua\NLuo Family Tribe Leader
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.37,0:03:37.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Outsider,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,return my tribe members
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:41.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,and fuck off my tribe's territory !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.01,0:03:51.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't come any closer !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.29,0:03:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you're looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:55.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't here !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,What I'm looking for ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.05,0:04:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,An avatar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:14.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:20.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation uses neither spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.29,0:04:22.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,nor celestial spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet it somehow rivals my Ancient God Restrictions...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:28.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.13,0:04:32.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,I thought you had more tricks up your sleeve
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,but you’re nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.53,0:04:47.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how different, it's all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:48.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,No matter how complex a formation is,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.77,0:04:50.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's always nothing more than a type of restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.33,0:04:52.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as I can understand it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,it can be unraveled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:04:59.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Impossible !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.53,0:05:01.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:03.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're actually breaking the formation !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.89,0:05:05.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare me, Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:07.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ouyang Hua
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.73,0:05:08.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.09,0:05:10.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation protects the lives of my tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:13.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg Celestial to understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.05,0:05:14.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,please don't destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Open the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.17,0:05:44.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.49,0:05:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,They don't have a hint of spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.45,0:05:52.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,yet are able to control this huge formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.81,0:05:53.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's really weird...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.45,0:05:55.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.37,0:05:57.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,mystery of this valley ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.81,0:06:06.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Da Bao, Xiao Bao, come home for dinner !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.89,0:06:17.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,They’re...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:19.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,all mortals ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,The child meant no offense,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.53,0:06:26.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hope Celestial doesn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:30.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,I assumed such a powerful formation had to be guarding something
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:33.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it’s just a village of mortals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade bottle contains several dozen pills
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.33,0:06:38.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,to strengthen your foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for bothering you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:41.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,I shall take my leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.21,0:06:46.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial, please wait !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.33,0:06:48.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Demon Spirit Night is about to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.37,0:06:50.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's already dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.21,0:06:52.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,If Celestial doesn’t mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.65,0:06:54.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,please stay here for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.97,0:06:57.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Demon Spirit Night ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:02.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,On every full moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.85,0:07:05.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,all the demon spirits lurking in the Demon Spirit Land
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,come out to hunt
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:10.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,and kill every living thing in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:12.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over time,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.65,0:07:14.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,people began calling this night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.45,0:07:16.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Demon Spirit Night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.45,0:07:19.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Legend has it that countless years ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.89,0:07:23.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,a celestial brought our ancestors here to settle
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.77,0:07:25.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,and laid down this formation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.17,0:07:29.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,to spare us from the scourge of the Demon Spirit Nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.45,0:07:31.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Patriarch Huanglong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:35.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,How do you know the name of Celestial Huang Long ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.53,0:07:36.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:38.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.85,0:07:42.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Huanglong I knew was only at Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,He can't be the same person as this painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:48.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,You said that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:51.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,this place doesn’t have what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:52.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is it exactly ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.93,0:07:59.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,That item is tied to the life of my tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.05,0:08:01.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you take it by force,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:03.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will hurt our tribe members' foundations
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:06.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,and they may even wither and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:07.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's why
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,I tried to stop you from entering the tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.41,0:08:13.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,if Celestial still has those pills you gave us earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,to strengthen our tribe members' foundations,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.65,0:08:23.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,we would willingly give Celestial what he's looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.85,0:08:26.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is this enough ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.01,0:08:28.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes... it's enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.05,0:08:30.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Celestial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:32.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,An outsider’s pills
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.77,0:08:34.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,are worth a fortune in the Demon Spirit Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.45,0:08:36.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.45,0:08:37.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,please follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.93,0:08:39.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll take you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:41.90,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(322,454)}Back mountain\Nof the Luo Family Tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:46.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,This fluctuation
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:48.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,isn't celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.53,0:08:49.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial's eye is keen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,This isn't celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.73,0:08:54.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the unique demonic energy of the Demon Spirit Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.66,0:08:57.62,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1462,428)}Rank 1 Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:55.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,What you're looking for
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.13,0:08:59.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,is precisely this Demon Spirit Crystal, condensed from demonic energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.65,0:09:02.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,No wonder he showed no hints of spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.25,0:09:05.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,but was able to operate the formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.93,0:09:07.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be the key in this Demon Spirit Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.69,0:09:21.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will cultivate here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.81,0:09:23.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,You may leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:24.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.81,0:09:40.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll make it through the night
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:41.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,and we'll survive !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.05,0:09:46.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,The demon spirits seem unusually fierce tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.17,0:09:48.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the formation can’t hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:49.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,will...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.21,0:09:52.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Will he help us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:08.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Patriarch !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:11.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is the demonic energy so strong tonight ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can it be this powerful !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:14.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Hold the line !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.77,0:10:16.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:18.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don’t panic !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:31.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,It’s over !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.85,0:10:34.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,We’re all doomed !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:39.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.61,0:10:40.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial has come !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Return to the valley !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.45,0:11:02.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:03.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,show yourself !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:13.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your cultivation isn't bad
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.41,0:11:16.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be able to sense my presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.34,0:11:16.50,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(458,511)\fad(300,000)}Luo Yun\NHeavenly Ghost Sect\NPeak Late stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:23.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you from the Da Lou Sword Sect ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.97,0:11:27.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Out of respect for your sect,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:30.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you hand over your Demon Spirit Crystal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:31.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll spare your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.33,0:11:36.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's what you get for refusing my kindness !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.53,0:11:40.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death Finger !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.73,0:11:49.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,This spell...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the same one that I saw at the All-Seer's birthday...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:54.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.29,0:11:56.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the All-Seer's new disciple !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:11:58.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Seventh Purple Disciple,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:00.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,This man can fight an Ascendant...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.69,0:12:04.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I knew it was him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have provoked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.05,0:12:10.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can’t escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.45,0:12:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even if you’re a prodigy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,you’re only at Middle stage Soul Transformation !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:18.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.81,0:12:20.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,are pushing your luck !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.01,0:12:24.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,Forbidden Devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.53,0:12:27.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fourth Heavenly Ghost !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.97,0:12:54.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,You forced me to wound my own Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:56.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,and use a forbidden spell !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:57.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,You deserve
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.37,0:12:59.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:07.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,A soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.49,0:13:10.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.57,0:13:23.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,This will allow the Soul Lasher to evolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.13,0:13:25.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Heavenly Ghost’s soul
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:28.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,will feed the Soul Lasher !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:33.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,An artifact specialized in damaging souls ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:56.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:58.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Celestial !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:01.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,I’ll borrow your back mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.29,0:14:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't disturb me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:04.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,unless it’s urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:10.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,the back mountain is a forbidden area.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.25,0:14:12.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's off limits !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.97,0:14:14.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the tribe's rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:15.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who violate it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.09,0:14:17.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be banished outside
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.65,0:14:18.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,to fend for themselves !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.09,0:14:19.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciples of the Heavenly Ghost Sect are protected by ghost spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.61,0:14:35.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,my master, Daoist Ghost, will avenge me !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.17,0:14:38.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the All-Seer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.53,0:14:41.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,treats my master as a peer !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:42.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.33,0:14:44.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,think carefully !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.77,0:14:50.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to Soul Search me !?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:54.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,My master will never let you go !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:02.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Demon Spirit Land is divided into 9 countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.45,0:15:04.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each country is ruled by a Demon Emperor
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:06.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,and has over 100 cities governed by
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.61,0:15:09.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,8 Demon Generals under the Demon Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.85,0:15:12.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,These 9 countries
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.73,0:15:15.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,each belong to one of the 9 Ancient Demon Spirits
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.57,0:15:17.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,that live in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.01,0:15:21.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fusing with an Ancient Demon Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:24.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the true goal of us cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.77,0:15:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ancient Demon Spirits are naturally born of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:31.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,If a cultivator fuses with one,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.61,0:15:33.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,not only will their cultivation surge
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.37,0:15:35.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,but they’ll also gain heaven-defying abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:38.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,Luo Yun’s memories even mention a rumor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.89,0:15:40.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who fuse with an Ancient Demon Spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.01,0:15:41.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,have a tiny chance
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.45,0:15:44.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,of entering a state known as the Beginning of the Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.41,0:15:47.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,Beginning of the Soul ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.81,0:15:49.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:51.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Shi Realm ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.81,0:15:56.45,Ji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\move(1141,700,1565,700)}Ji Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:56.46,Shi,,0,0,0,,{\fax-.5\fay.5\fad(300,000)\move(132,349,491,393)}Shi Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.82,0:15:56.46,Dao,,0,0,0,,{\fr310\fad(300,000)\move(-140,600,148,600)}Dao Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.85,0:15:56.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The 3 legendary realms involve spiritual energy and Divine Sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.17,0:15:58.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I grasp Death from the Ji Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.17,0:16:00.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Life from the Shi Realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:03.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,my Dao of Life and Death
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:05.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,might one day reach a higher state.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's too early to be thinking about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.85,0:16:12.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,According to Luo Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:14.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,only with enough demonic energy
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:16.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,and by accumulating military merit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.69,0:16:20.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,can one earn an audience with the Ancient Demon Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:23.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm currently in the Sky Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the nearest city is Ancient Demon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.37,0:16:28.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,Luo Yun invaded the valley
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.13,0:16:31.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,for this rank 1 Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.46,0:16:34.02,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(383,436)}Rank 2 Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.65,0:16:34.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,to merge it with his rank 2 crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.49,0:16:37.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,and gain qualifications to enter Ancient Demon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:37.30,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(277,438)}Rank 3 Demon Spirit Crystal
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.77,0:16:39.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then, as a soldier in the army,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.09,0:16:42.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,he would join in campaigns
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:44.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,to accumulate merit
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.45,0:16:47.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,and rise through the ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:50.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the path most cultivators will choose to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.37,0:16:59.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,But joining the army as a soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:01.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,would leave me at the mercy of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:02.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.37,0:17:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,it might be better to teach the tribe how to make Soul Flags
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.45,0:17:08.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,to build an army of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:19:18.94,Note,,0,0,0,,Quick reminder of the 3 legendary realms of spiritual energy and Divine Sense because it was never really explained in the donghua.\N\N- The Ji Realm, the extreme realm that grants unprecedented power and represents Death.\N- The Shi Realm, if Ji is Death then Shi is Life.\N- The Dao Realm, the most sought after and the most mysterious.\N\NWang Lin lacks information at the moment about the Shi and Dao Realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:26.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}I've been walking this path for endless years
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.68,0:17:26.02,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:31.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is it the compass of fate
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.50,0:17:31.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that wrote this outcome for us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:37.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}The heavens want to erase your existence,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.66,0:17:43.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}that's the obsession guiding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:48.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}Is this the path to uncover
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.42,0:17:48.86,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}truths from falsehoods ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:54.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}In a world of murk and shadow,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:54.46,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,700)}only the flame of truth can light the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.50,0:18:00.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.38,0:18:00.18,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}being carried by the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.62,0:18:04.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Look at them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.78,0:18:04.82,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}being drowned.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:08.14,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:11.22,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I will let the world refine my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.35,0:18:16.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,500)}So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.04,0:18:16.78,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:19.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}I'll break through the abyss of despair
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.90,0:18:22.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}to finally learn who I really am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:28.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.82,0:18:28.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,300)}I embrace this obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:31.26,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,300)}I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.26,0:18:34.06,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,100)}Even if this suffering shatters my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.06,0:18:39.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,700)}and I'm reborn countless times in hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:39.54,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,700)}I'll still fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:42.90,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}It's hard to avoid loneliness
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.90,0:18:45.94,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}when you are above everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.94,0:18:51.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:51.62,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)}be afraid of a firefly ?
